From: Martin Pluskal <martin@pluskal.org>
Subject: workflows run only in yolo mode

The TUI and the -p broker answered CreateWorkflow and AmendWorkflow with
allow by tool name, in every mode, and a workflow's world.run runs any
command without a permission check. Both now allow them in yolo mode
only and deny them otherwise, naming the mode to switch to. Core denies
them while plan mode is on, since plan entered from yolo leaves the mode
the clients see at yolo, and applies the owner rule (an AmendWorkflow of
a run this session started goes unasked) in yolo mode only.

Patch-mainline: No

